'''Heavenly Le'saint''' (大天使エルファント, ''Daitenshi Erufanto'', '''Archangel Eruphant''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Le'boin]] that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 7.3 Update|Version 7.3]].

