==Enemy==
Heavenly Le'saint has a faster attack rate than both [[Le'boin]] and [[Lord Enma]], with higher health, attack power and a [[Strengthen|strengthen]] ability that raises his attack power by 100% at 50% HP. However, Le'saint's attack animation is longer than that of any other Le'boin variant and he has 80 less range than the regular Le'boin.

==Strategy==
Since Heavenly Le'saint has even shorter range than Lord Enma, more units can outrange it and defeat it when paired with meatshields such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]]. Some attackers that can outrange him are [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]].

Instead of using traditional meatshields, another alternative is to use [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] because of his sturdiness, attack power and resistance against Angels, making him the perfect fit to defeat this Angelic titan when paired with the ranged attackers mentioned above.

