==Trivia==
*Heavenly Le'saint's Japanese name, 大天使エルファント ''Daitenshi Erufanto'' ("Archangel Eruphant") is a pun combining エル ''eru'' (''El'', the Hebrew word for God) with エレファント ''erefanto'' (elephant).
*Heavenly Le'saint, [[Archangel Exiel]] and [[Great Angel Chibinel]] all have the word 大天使 ''daitenshi'' (archangel; lit. "great angel") in their Japanese names.
**Heavenly Le'saint is the only one who isn't a [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]].
*The kanji on Heavenly Le'saint's forehead is 天, meaning "heaven" or "sky".
*Despite consisting of both a [[Le'boin]] and a [[Doge]], there's only one halo, which may imply that one of them is not actually an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]].
*He received the name Heavenly Le'Saint when he was added to the [[Enemy Guide]] in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]]. The [[Media:Eve l 020 en.png|event poster]] for [[Ghostly Strangers (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Strangers]] refers to him as just Le'saint, while the [[Media:August Gauntlet II Splash.png|event poster]] for [[August Gauntlet II]] calls him heavenly Le'Saint, but without "heavenly" being meant as part of his name, as "h" isn't capitalized and the event's description still just says Le'Saint.

